//! Provider-free protocol, preparation, and evidence gates for `native_correction_v1`.
//!
//! This family deliberately stands apart from the learned-procedure native-memory pilot. It
//! measures one narrow installed-host behavior: a restricted agent proposes a structured,
//! inactive procedure correction; a distinct full-profile operator verifies its exact receipt
//! while inactive, observes the P0-to-P1 digest rotation, and applies only P1; and a fresh
//! restricted process retrieves only the replacement. The module never treats operator selection
//! as authenticated human identity, verified intent, human review, or reviewer authority.

